{"html":"<h3 id=\"heading-0\" data-id=\"heading-0\">简介</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>西南地区某大学软件工程专业</li>\n<li>全栈（全干）工程师</li>\n<li>爱好语言学</li>\n<li><del>落魄预备化竞生</del></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"heading-1\" data-id=\"heading-1\">该网站主要前端技术栈</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>React</li>\n<li>TypeScript</li>\n<li>JavaScript</li>\n<li>Redux &amp; Redux-Saga</li>\n<li>Axios</li>\n<li>Node.js</li>\n<li>Scss</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"heading-2\" data-id=\"heading-2\">日常技术栈</h3>\n<p><strong>Systems &amp; Desktop</strong></p>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/C++-00599c?style=flat-square&logo=cplusplus&logoColor=white\" alt=\"C++\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Qt-41cd52?style=flat-square&logo=qt&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Qt\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Rust-ffa500?style=flat-square&logo=rust&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Rust\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/C%23-512BD4?style=flat-square&logo=dotnet&logoColor=white\" alt=\"C#\">\n\n<p><strong>Frontend</strong></p>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/HTML5-E34F26?style=flat-square&logo=html5&logoColor=white\" alt=\"HTML5\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CSS3-1572B6?style=flat-square&logo=css3&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CSS3\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/JavaScript-F7DF1E?style=flat-square&logo=javascript&logoColor=000000\" alt=\"JavaScript\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-3178c6?style=flat-square&logo=typescript&logoColor=white\" alt=\"TypeScript\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/React-61DAFB?style=flat-square&logo=react&logoColor=20232A\" alt=\"React\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Vue.js-4FC08D?style=flat-square&logo=vuedotjs&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Vue.js\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Node.js-5FA04E?style=flat-square&logo=nodedotjs&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Node.js\">\n\n<p><strong>Backend</strong></p>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Java-ED8B00?style=flat-square&logo=openjdk&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Java\">\n\n<p><strong>Scripting &amp; Tools</strong></p>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3776AB?style=flat-square&logo=python&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Python\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Shell-4EAA25?style=flat-square&logo=gnubash&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Shell\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Haskell-5D4F85?style=flat-square&logo=haskell&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Haskell\">\n\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h5 id=\"heading-3\" data-id=\"heading-3\">欢迎大佬联系指正！</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><p>🐧QQ: <code>398908838</code></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>✉️E-mail: <code>lengineerc@outlook.com</code></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>🔗github: <a href=\"https://github.com/LengineerC\">LengineerC</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n","toc":[{"id":"heading-0","level":3,"text":"简介","listNo":"1"},{"id":"heading-1","level":3,"text":"该网站主要前端技术栈","listNo":"2"},{"id":"heading-2","level":3,"text":"日常技术栈","listNo":"3"},{"id":"heading-3","level":5,"text":"欢迎大佬联系指正！","listNo":"3.1.1"}],"characterCount":2145}